{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "52320906-a1c9-431c-bdf6-e41ac63157bb"/*AssimpImportExample*/,
  "Description": "Loads a glTF model with [AssimpImport] and draws it with its PBR materials through [DrawScene].\n\n[AssimpImport] reads 40+ formats, including FBX, glTF/GLB, OBJ, Collada, STL and PLY. The example uses the DamagedHelmet from the Examples assets; select the AssimpImport node and change FilePath to load any other model. Its Geometry output keeps N-gons for the procedural geometry operators, and its Setup output carries the materials, skeleton and animation clips.\n\nAKA: assimp, import, model, fbx, gltf, glb, obj, dae, stl, ply, pbr\n\nSee also: [AssimpImport], [AssimpExport], [LoadGltfScene], [DrawScene]",
